# Code owners for interledger-app
#
# Every path listed here requires a review from @interledger/interledger-app
# before it can be merged. Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the
# branch protection rules for `main` and the `*.x` maintenance branches,
# otherwise this file is advisory only.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so the security-sensitive paths at the
# bottom of this file deliberately override the catch-all above them.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
*                               @interledger/interledger-app

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CI/CD and supply chain
#
# These paths can execute arbitrary code with repository credentials, publish
# artifacts, or change what runs on the self-hosted E2E runners. A change here
# must never be merged without a maintainer reading the diff.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.github/                       @interledger/interledger-app
/.github/workflows/             @interledger/interledger-app
/.github/actions/               @interledger/interledger-app
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @interledger/interledger-app
/tooling/                       @interledger/interledger-app

# Dependency manifests and lockfiles — a poisoned transitive dependency runs
# in CI (and in the E2E runner) before any human sees the result.
/renovate.json                  @interledger/interledger-app
/package.json                   @interledger/interledger-app
/pnpm-lock.yaml                 @interledger/interledger-app
/go.work                        @interledger/interledger-app
/go.work.sum                    @interledger/interledger-app
**/go.mod                       @interledger/interledger-app
**/go.sum                       @interledger/interledger-app
**/pnpm-lock.yaml               @interledger/interledger-app
**/package.json                 @interledger/interledger-app

# Container build definitions — executed during CI builds.
**/Dockerfile                   @interledger/interledger-app
**/Dockerfile.*                 @interledger/interledger-app
**/.dockerignore                @interledger/interledger-app
/local/                         @interledger/interledger-app

# Deployment surface.
/helm/                          @interledger/interledger-app
/k8s/                           @interledger/interledger-app

# Security policy and disclosure process.
/SECURITY.md                    @interledger/interledger-app
